  "DotReact": "DotReact",
  "DotReact — React SSR para .NET": "DotReact — React SSR for .NET",
  "DotReact adota a ergonomia que torna o Next produtivo — arquivo por rota, layouts, boundaries, navegação parcial, SSR, geração estática e actions — mas não replica o backend JavaScript. Tudo que acessa identidade, banco, secrets ou executa efeitos pertence ao ASP.NET Core.": "DotReact adopts the ergonomics that make Next productive — file per route, layouts, boundaries, partial navigation, SSR, static generation and actions — but does not replicate the JavaScript backend. Everything that accesses identity, database, secrets or performs effects belongs to ASP.NET Core.",
  "dotreact architecture": "dotreact architecture",
  "dotreact check": "dotreact check",
  "DotReact deliberadamente mantém o backend público em ASP.NET Core.": "DotReact deliberately keeps the backend public in ASP.NET Core.",
  "dotreact doctor": "dotreat doctor",
  "DotReact é adequado": "DotReact is suitable",
  "DotReact emite URLs relativas para cliente, CSS e módulos. O HTML não deve conter": "DotReact outputs relative URLs for client, CSS and modules. HTML must not contain",
  "DotReact existe especificamente para equipes que escolheram React.": "DotReact exists specifically for teams that chose React.",
  "DotReact existe para equipes que querem a ergonomia de páginas React/TSX, SSR, navegação fluida e Server Actions, mas precisam manter ASP.NET Core como backend e autoridade de segurança. HTTP, autenticação, autorização, serviços e dados ficam no C#; o renderer Node é privado e recebe somente contratos JSON versionados.": "DotReact exists for teams that want the ergonomics of React/TSX pages, SSR, fluid navigation and Server Actions, but need to maintain ASP.NET Core as the backend and security authority. HTTP, authentication, authorization, services and data are in C#; the Node renderer is private and only receives versioned JSON contracts.",
  "dotreact generate page invoices/[id]": "dotreact generate page invoices/[id]",
  "DotReact já fornece fallbacks seguros de loading, 404 e erro no core.": "DotReact already provides safe loading, 404 and error fallbacks in core.",
  "DotReact mantém o backend público em ASP.NET Core. O renderer Node é privado e não vira um runtime de API na borda. Distribuição global deve usar CDN, Azure Front Door, containers ou infraestrutura .NET apropriada.": "DotReact maintains the public backend in ASP.NET Core. The Node renderer is private and does not become an API runtime on the edge. Global distribution must use CDN, Azure Front Door, containers, or appropriate .NET infrastructure.",
  "DotReact publica ActivitySource e Meter estáveis. Quando": "DotReact publishes stable ActivitySource and Meter. When",
  "DotReact serve para construir aplicações React com SSR, hydration, navegação parcial e componentes interativos sem transferir autenticação, autorização, domínio ou persistência para JavaScript. A aplicação pública continua sendo um host ASP.NET Core; React é o renderer universal da interface.": "DotReact is for building React applications with SSR, hydration, partial navigation and interactive components without transferring authentication, authorization, domain or persistence to JavaScript. The public application remains an ASP.NET Core host; React is the universal interface renderer.",
