  "Em proxy ou Cloudflare, aplique forwarded headers confiáveis antes do desafio para gerar callback HTTPS correto.": "Behind a proxy or Cloudflare, apply trusted forwarded headers before the challenge so it generates the correct HTTPS callback.",
  "Em uma action bem-sucedida, paths e tags são invalidados automaticamente antes da resposta. A invalidação do cache de props gira tokens versionados sem enumerar chaves Redis; entradas antigas ficam inacessíveis imediatamente e somem pelo TTL. O header e o callback cliente continuam usando paths para atualizar a UI local.": "On a successful action, paths and tags are automatically invalidated before responding. Prop cache invalidation rotates versioned tokens without enumerating Redis keys; old entries become inaccessible immediately and disappear by TTL. The header and client callback continue to use paths to update the local UI.",
  "emite manifest determinístico para App Service/Container Apps, valida streaming, imagem, shared cache e PPR de forma fail-closed e nunca grava valores de secrets. PPR no adapter exige Azure Managed Redis explicitamente.": "issues deterministic manifest for App Service/Container Apps, validates streaming, image, shared cache and PPR in a fail-closed way and never writes secret values. PPR on the adapter requires Azure Managed Redis explicitly.",
